WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.600
The Krovi pill springs open into the panel.

00:02.600 --> 00:05.200
The Agent tool is chosen.

00:05.200 --> 00:10.000
A sentence is typed: open youtube and search youtube for lofi, then remind me in 20 minutes to stretch.

00:10.000 --> 00:14.500
A plan of three steps appears. Opening YouTube and searching it are done. The reminder waits on a card that says Needs your OK, with its date and time.

00:14.500 --> 00:19.500
Add reminder is pressed, and all three steps are done.
